WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.773
A solo class can now pause, leave or finish, and the clock, the plan and the video

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:08.960
move together.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.180
Pause holds the clock, the plan and the video at the same second. The picture says

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.434
Paused, and the stepper stays on.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.104
Resume carries on from that second, with the video sought back onto the clock.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.572
If the bike stops answering in a solo class, the ride waits for it, and an alert

00:00:35.572 --> 00:00:37.252
says so, with Reconnect.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.052
Reconnect tries the bike at once. When it is back, the last level goes first, and

00:00:46.052 --> 00:00:47.527
the ride carries on.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.820
The ride's own ticks stop while it is held, so the bike is watched on the app's

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:56.758
second beat.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.365
Leave goes straight to Class Start, with no confirmation, and nothing more goes to

00:01:06.365 --> 00:01:07.151
the bike.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.574
At thirty minutes the clock stops, the video pauses, and Results opens.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.421
The screen stays awake for the whole ride, and closing the tab mid-ride asks first.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.497
On a phone, Pause is a forty-eight pixel icon. From tablet width, it has its label.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.079
What the tests prove: six new specs and seven wake-lock cases, and every check is

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:48.738
green.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
